    <string name="app_description">Student menus translated with Google Translate (ML Kit) or a custom LLM endpoint. https://cloud.google.com/translate</string>
    <string name="translation_help">Menus are translated on this device using Google Translate (ML Kit), from Slovenian into the app language. Language models are downloaded once. Menu text is not sent to a server for on-device translation.\n\nSuccessful translations are stored locally and reused across restaurants. Tap a menu item to switch its title and sides between the translation and original. Automatic translations can misinterpret ingredients and are not reliable allergen information.\n\nhttps://cloud.google.com/translate\n\nTHIS SERVICE MAY CONTAIN TRANSLATIONS POWERED BY GOOGLE. GOOGLE DISCLAIMS ALL WARRANTIES RELATED TO THE TRANSLATIONS, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING ANY WARRANTIES OF ACCURACY, RELIABILITY, AND ANY IMPLIED WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT.</string>
